 "n6378b5b9c21": {
  "row": 234,
  "sub": 2,
  "lines": [],
  "add": "- **Andhras at Calcutta (Sept 1920):** **Konda Venkatappayya** first opposed the resolution, then **resigned from the Madras Legislature**; Pattabhi, Duggirala, Kaleswara Rao, Peta Bapayya also attended."
 },
 "n7873d7967ee": {
